#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:5 7ae68ffe87e74527b3062177c5180bee
msgid "Introduction to Plane"
msgstr "Plane 简介"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:7 f8751b0403644903a4550aaffe273881
msgid ""
"Plane is an advanced open-source autopilot firmwware system for conventional"
" planes, flying wings, and VTOL capable QuadPlanes.  It offers a :ref:`wide "
"variety of flight modes <flight-modes>` from fully manual to fully "
"autonomous."
msgstr ""
"Plane 是一款先进的开源飞控固件系统，适用于传统固定翼飞机、飞翼以及支持 VTOL 的 QuadPlane。它提供从完全手动到完全自主的 "
":ref:`多种飞行模式 <flight-modes>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:11 bc6b9e365ee8413e94ea50b5d29d3b65
msgid ""
"As part of the wider ArduPilot software platform it works seamlessly with a "
"variety of :ref:`Ground Control Station programs <common-GCS>` that are used"
" to setup the vehicle, monitor the vehicle's flight in real-time and perform"
" powerful mission planning activities. It also benefits from other parts of "
"the ArduPilot ecosystem, including simulators, log analysis tools, and "
"higher level APIs for vehicle control."
msgstr ""
"作为更广泛的 ArduPilot 软件平台的一部分，它与各种 :ref:`地面控制站程序 <common-GCS>` "
"无缝配合，用于设置飞行器、实时监控飞行以及执行强大的任务规划活动。它还受益于 ArduPilot "
"生态系统的其他部分，包括模拟器、日志分析工具以及用于飞行器控制的高级 API。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:14 1ba434b082d84ad4b55ab53e2a53b663
msgid ""
"ArduPilot is already a preferred software platform for numerous commercially"
" available autopilot systems but you can also use it to enhance the "
"abilities of your own DIY planes or convert normal RC only systems into "
"fully featured autonomous aircraft."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 已经是众多商业飞控系统的首选软件平台，您也可以用它来增强自己的 DIY 飞机能力，或将普通的纯遥控系统转换为功能完备的自主飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:16 04282451aae04a109b6c3abb702db622
msgid ""
"Please do not be tempted to skip over steps and rush into flight. This is "
"robotics and aviation combined -- both of which are quite complex on their "
"own. Take some time to become familiar with documentation. Follow the steps "
"patiently, and you will get your vehicle safely up in the air."
msgstr ""
"请不要因为急于飞行而跳过某些步骤。这涉及机器人技术和航空两个领域，各自都相当复杂。请花些时间熟悉文档，耐心地按步骤操作，您将安全地将飞行器飞上天空。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:22 7c24c969a5a946a7b7640e6c0bedef37
msgid ""
":ref:`Selecting an autopilot controller for your system <common-autopilots>`"
msgstr ":ref:`为您的系统选择飞控 <common-autopilots>`"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:23 4b7d2e581dd54905a8c1e190216df6cd
msgid ""
":ref:`First Time Setup <arduplane-setup>`- Installing: hardware, software, "
"and firmware. Plugging in: Sensors, radios, batteries, motors, etc."
msgstr ""
":ref:`First Time Setup <arduplane-setup>`- 安装：硬件、软件和固件。连接：传感器、无线电、电池、电机等。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:24 711fb8914e014d99836b5335679576f8
msgid ""
":ref:`Configuration <plane-configuration-landing-page>`- Designate control "
"outputs for flying surfaces. Establish telemetry and control between: "
"vehicle, ground-station, and RC-control transmitter. Set up flight modes, "
"program failsafe behavior, calibrate sensors and motor-controllers, and "
"verify correct motor operation."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Configuration <plane-configuration-landing-page>`- "
"为飞行舵面指定控制输出。建立飞行器、地面站和遥控器之间的数传和控制。设置飞行模式、编程失控保护行为、校准传感器和电调，并验证电机操作是否正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:25 316fac41584d4ef882dfcfdedf497517
msgid ""
":ref:`First Flight and Tuning <first-flight-landing-page>`- First test "
"flight and tuning stabilization, and speed/height controller"
msgstr ""
":ref:`First Flight and Tuning <first-flight-landing-page>`- "
"首次试飞及稳定性、速度/高度控制器调参"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:26 573bb9a290574badb5231cc76d7ccae0
msgid ""
":ref:`Mission planning <common-mission-planning>` - Programming missions."
msgstr ":ref:`Mission planning <common-mission-planning>` - 任务编程。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:31 534554543ad1472898f194a2b95a4467
msgid "**The topic of safety should be foremost on your mind.**"
msgstr "**安全问题应是您最重要的考虑。**"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:33 b7cc445d9254446b978266ee1b28f4de
msgid ""
"**Autonomous vehicles are high-energy systems driving rotating blades -- you"
" are in charge of these potential hazards.**"
msgstr "**自主飞行器是驱动旋转叶片的高能系统——您负责管控这些潜在危险。**"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:38 813072d02ef84090af9bfef4b14bbed8
msgid ""
"*ArduPilot supported autopilots and peripherals are designed to easily "
"integrate with most standard RC aircraft, from simple high-wing trainers to "
"high-speed swept wing fighters and flying wings, to QuadPlane . If you have "
"something out of the ordinary please assume that a bit more tuning will be "
"required to get things dialed in.*"
msgstr ""
"*ArduPilot 支持的飞控和外设设计为可轻松集成到大多数标准遥控飞机，从简单的高翼教练机到高速后掠翼战斗机和飞翼，再到 "
"QuadPlane。如果您的飞机较为特殊，请预计需要进行更多调参才能让其正常工作。*"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:45 884e211fc22c4b8c9030a735db42274b
msgid "Vehicle Configuration Types"
msgstr "飞行器配置类型"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:47 e5464668ef1b43d49c0dd2aeca82f906
msgid ""
"Aileron/Elevator/Rudder/Throttle Conventional Planes both as TailDraggers or"
" Tricycle Gear"
msgstr "副翼/升降舵/方向舵/油门传统飞机，包括后三点式或前三点式起落架"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:48 1261a908408a44008b432f0df513e6cd
msgid "Elevon based flying wings"
msgstr "基于升降副翼的飞翼"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:49 cb786607f2294b3292b5f72aec7eefb9
msgid "V-Tail rudder/elevator control"
msgstr "V 形尾翼方向舵/升降舵控制"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:50 cd04feaa7e7247d897908b8f58dcaf55
msgid "Differential Aileron/Spoiler Flap"
msgstr "差动副翼/扰流板襟翼"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:55 5be30d3858894c28a1a3de147821dc95
msgid "QuadPlane VTOL"
msgstr "QuadPlane VTOL"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:52 b5ac039a86d04ba1aceee850454793f3
msgid "SLT - fixed wing motor plus separate VTOL motors"
msgstr "SLT - 固定翼电机加独立 VTOL 电机"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:53 c6c836c06589442791d27d5f54d7aec8
msgid ""
"Tilt-Rotors - which tilt motors from vertical for VTOL to horizontal for "
"fixed wing operation"
msgstr "倾转旋翼 - 电机从 VTOL 的垂直位置倾转到固定翼操作的水平位置"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:54 0cb570cbc9304980bb11872f7e91dde7
msgid ""
"Tailsitters - which takeoff and land with the nose vertical instead of "
"horizontal"
msgstr "尾坐式 - 机头垂直而非水平地起飞和降落"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:58 88a28a88cb894b45b032281ae093fbe2
msgid "Flight Features"
msgstr "飞行功能"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:60 98f56973a1e742edb4c774b632f8091a
msgid ""
"Plane has many advanced and complex features such as Automatic Takeoffs and "
"Landings, Commercial Aircraft Avoidance, GeoFencing, Terrain Following, "
"Moving Ship Takeoffs and Landings, Autonomous Soaring and Aerobatics. See "
":ref:`flight-features` for more information."
msgstr ""
"Plane 拥有许多先进而复杂的功能，例如自动起飞和降落、商业飞机规避、地理围栏、地形跟随、移动船舰起降、自主热翔和特技飞行。更多信息请参见 "
":ref:`flight-features`。"

#: ../../source/docs/introduction.rst:64 7f5b1d2898f64c64af5e11e0dbebea55
msgid ""
"All of us involved with this project care a great deal about the privacy and"
" safety of those whom we share this planet with. Please be a good steward of"
" this technology. It is the product of many evenings and weekends, we make "
"it available for benevolent use."
msgstr ""
"我们所有参与此项目的人都非常关心与我们共享这个星球的人的隐私和安全。请成为这项技术的良好管理者。这是许多个晚上和周末的心血结晶，我们将其用于造福社会。"
